{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12114190","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:6:1211419001:0":{"text":"역시 기믹이 맞았어.\n신밧드, 조금 전에 찾은 그 종이 좀 줄래?","source_cn":"果然是机关。\\n辛巴达，你把刚才找到的那张白纸给我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA5EF9AEC0AD2369","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211419002:0":{"text":"자, 뭐 하게? 코라도 풀게?","source_cn":"喏。你要干什么？擦鼻涕？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B0942EC6D14BF0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211419003:0":{"text":"...우리가 서로 농담할 정도로 친했나?","source_cn":"……我们不是能开玩笑的关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x332D6A79274C2F3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211419004:0":{"text":"예이예이, 당신은 귀하디귀하신 블러디 로즈의 두목이시죠.","source_cn":"是是，您可是尊贵的血薇帮当家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70FF6B7602EED111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211419005:1":{"text":"말다툼할 기분 아니라고.","source_cn":"我没心情和你斗嘴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE8B370F8A90246D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211419006:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 이 종이는 그냥 종이가 아닐 거야.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF9198AFCBAC8B0B5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 이 종이는 그냥 종이가 아닐 거야.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 이 종이는 그냥 종이가 아닐 거야.","variant_male_record_index":"132181","variant_female_record_index":"132182","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:14::0":{"text":"빈 종이","source_cn":"空白的纸","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52406B157CD0D2C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1211419007:0":{"text":"불씨로 가열하면...","source_cn":"如果用火苗将它加热——","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFA491B34EA1D9F00","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"불씨로 가열하면...","female":"불씨로 가열하면...","variant_male_record_index":"132183","variant_female_record_index":"132184","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:17::0":{"text":"지명 수배","source_cn":"通缉令","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8106E922562BCCC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211419008:0":{"text":"이건... 지명수배서야!","source_cn":"这是……通缉令！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27B6E46286734224","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1211419009:0":{"text":"“<style=\"highlight\">반티스 제국의 성물을 훔친 죄인 호드킨을</style>... 전국에 지명 수배한다...”","source_cn":"“<style=highlight>霍德希金窃取班题斯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AE62D55B1B171A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211419010:0":{"text":"반티스에 관한 자료는 거의 없어요. 저도 그곳은 그레이브본이 모인 미스터리한 제국이라는 것밖에 모를 정도니까요.","source_cn":"班题斯……关于那里的资料很稀少，我只知道，那是亡灵聚集...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4317CDD6FBB1C1BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1211419011:0":{"text":"흥, 호드킨의 보물은 전부 훔쳐 온 거였군. 훔친 물건으로 남의 구역에서 거들먹거리다니, 아주 대단하군.","source_cn":"哼，原来他手上的宝贝也是偷来的。借着偷来的东西，在别人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9B110FDCB2294A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1211419012:0":{"text":"어쨌거나 성물을 훔쳐 갔다는 건 그정도 실력이 된다는 거야. 방심해서는 안 돼.","source_cn":"能偷走圣器，他有些本领。我们不能大意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB09AEBEE27B26F31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1211419013:0":{"text":"자, 계속해서 이동하자.","source_cn":"各位，继续前进吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32E533DC04855CCA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:28:12011429:0":{"text":"수수께끼를 풀자 앞을 막고 있던 섬뜩한 도깨비불이 사라졌다.","source_cn":"解开谜题后，拦路的诡异鬼火消失了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7429404242E7D85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"소니아","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":16,"speaker_count":4}}